*==============================================================================*
* TIMES.jl reference harness hook (not part of TIMES).
* Included by main_ext.mod for stage equ_ext when 'TJLREF' is passed to
* initmty.mod, i.e. right after eqmain and the standard extensions' equ_ext
* (maindrv.mod L79-80, v4.9.7), before the MODEL statement, bndmain and pp_qack.
* A checkpoint for stepped (myopic) runs only (%STEPPED% set, initmty.mod
* L445-446), in runs the harness starts with --TJL_CHECKPOINTS=1 (the pre-solve
* run): there the end-of-run dump is the state after the loop of solve.stp has
* gone through every step (without solving), not the state the first step
* starts from, so this dump holds what the equation preparation left.
*==============================================================================*
$IF SET TJL_CHECKPOINTS $IF SET STEPPED execute_unload 'tjl_equ.gdx';
